{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他意识到自己需要对方，也开始坦然承认喜欢，不再为这份感情道歉；但心里知道两人未必能一直这么亲近。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"坦然、欢喜、珍惜、隐隐不安、心疼\",\n      \"missed\": \"对方有时也需要他，以及即使对方不需要仍愿意陪伴的关系细节；中间金色小字里的同一艘船、同一首歌、旋律变化和重走旧房子的画面，需要逐句读才能串起来。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他终于不再遮掩自己对对方的喜欢，也不觉得在乎对方有什么可羞耻的，但开始意识到这份亲近未必能一直持续。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"释然、开心、坦荡、温柔、酸涩、心疼\",\n      \"missed\": \"互相需要和主动陪伴的具体关系，以及音乐从谨慎收敛到直接真实的变化，不容易一眼读全；期待似乎得到满足却还没有结束的状态，也需要细读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他已经愿意公开承认自己的喜欢，不再为感情道歉，却因为不知道对方以后还需不需要自己，而对眼前的亲近感到珍惜和难过。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"坦然、欢喜、珍惜、脆弱、酸涩、想哭\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的夕阳灿烂却刺眼、让人想哭的画面，以及它和心里疼痛的对应关系，需要读到金色小字才能发现；旧房子带来的熟悉感与新重量也不容易一眼抓住。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"上面三块大字其实已经能组成一条清楚的情绪线：发现彼此需要、坦然承认喜欢、想到亲近可能无法长久而心疼。但中间金色小字同时放入船、歌、水波、旧房子、夕阳等多个意象，几条长句并排出现，和人物处境的对应关系不够直观。尤其第三张新增夕阳画面后，意象更多了，却没有更明确地帮助观众理解这个人的处境。整体不是看不懂，而是人物主线容易抓到，画面与感受之间还需要观众自己补一层联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d9cbe177-2eaa-4d47-9ac2-240a8540298e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T002640766726Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:27:55.075629+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "045fd724a3277060952f09f8385532b0530726dee949e09ffe1eab678555f3d2", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T002640766726Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "fc7ea484f36c9471a1332e69724f7c52cb0845afdd59ef93a3722f5bc52fde77"}}}
